p the 7 CLI flags entirely**, keep the TUI `a` cycle. Anyone wanting one-agent recap pipes through `--agent` once we expose it later — but in practice, `a` in TUI is the natural way.\n2. **Collapse the 7 to one `--agent <name>` string flag** with an enum constraint, keep the TUI cycle. This is the smallest change and keeps the \"headless static recap for one agent\" workflow possible (e.g., for cron jobs).\n\nEither way the TUI `a` key stays — that's where filtering actually feels useful (instant rebuild, see the difference).\n\nWhat's your gut? Drop them, or collapse to `--agent <name>`?"}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":737,"cache_read_input_tokens":179087,"output_tokens":1749,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":737,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":1,"output_tokens":1749,"cache_read_input_tokens":179087,"cache_creation_input_tokens":737,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":737},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CaUGQcYvNTM92ByjSSayv","type":"assistant","uuid":"f60688f0-1eef-4b0b-b66f-1df4a8edbf29","timestamp":"2026-04-27T12:21:42.203Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/peytonmontei/Documents/entire/devenv/entireio/cli/.worktrees/entire-activity","sessionId":"a654b6ca-4957-4d7c-8c99-62db313ff0a0","version":"2.1.119","gitBranch":"entire-activity"}
