Tokens` — that fixes your 54-vs-212 undercount because the server has cross-worktree visibility.\n\n**Tradeoffs:**\n- Range toggles will have a perceptible ~1-2s lag (production /me/recap latency we measured)\n- Need a spinner so it doesn't feel frozen\n- Adds error-handling code for the network failure case\n\nThis is meaningful work — maybe 100-150 lines in `tui.go` plus a bit in `BuildView` to prefer server me-side counts. Worth doing before flipping #1015 to ready-for-review since the bugs you noticed are exactly what a reviewer would catch first.\n\nWant me to go? Or do you want me to commit just the viewport scroll fix first as a checkpoint, then tackle the refetch as a second commit?"}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":6,"cache_creation_input_tokens":744,"cache_read_input_tokens":441511,"output_tokens":4959,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":744,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":6,"output_tokens":4959,"cache_read_input_tokens":441511,"cache_creation_input_tokens":744,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":744},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CaW7LXpkvTwAcwhWw7qeu","type":"assistant","uuid":"2272bac5-a75a-4b2f-96f7-4f84fdc3bdba","timestamp":"2026-04-28T11:44:46.266Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/peytonmontei/Documents/entire/devenv/entireio/cli/.worktrees/entire-activity","sessionId":"a654b6ca-4957-4d7c-8c99-62db313ff0a0","version":"2.1.119","gitBranch":"entire-activity"}
