ay, until-day)` with 5min TTL — first user per range pays the cost, rest get sub-100ms\n\nExpected production result: `--90` drops from ~2-5s to <500ms (counts) + <300ms (sample analyses) ≈ <1s total. Local wrangler still slower because of emulator overhead, but proportionally improved.\n\nEstimated work: ~1-1.5 hours, lands as a follow-up commit on PR #1604.\n\nWant me to do it? If yes, I'd:\n1. Build the aggregate queries in `planetscale/checkpoints.ts`\n2. Wire them into `recap.ts`, deleting the JS aggregator\n3. Cap team-side analysis fetch to 100 rows\n4. Update tests\n5. Re-time `--90` against local wrangler to confirm the win"}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":6,"cache_creation_input_tokens":393,"cache_read_input_tokens":501565,"output_tokens":4332,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":393,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":6,"output_tokens":4332,"cache_read_input_tokens":501565,"cache_creation_input_tokens":393,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":393},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CaWBtgGsAXxsXXwmBQQVp","type":"assistant","uuid":"b2eb2c38-3895-466d-9a9c-a86aae89094c","timestamp":"2026-04-28T12:44:19.591Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/peytonmontei/Documents/entire/devenv/entireio/cli/.worktrees/entire-activity","sessionId":"a654b6ca-4957-4d7c-8c99-62db313ff0a0","version":"2.1.119","gitBranch":"entire-activity"}
