{"parentUuid":"c8da00d8-b7f6-494f-9853-7a446a794e84","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-7","id":"msg_01DDYPMUfNN5GgZfaVuHu1dT","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"CI all green ✅ — PR #1604 ready. But you'll need `pscale` CLI for the schema deploy flow.\n\n```fish\nbrew install planetscale/tap/pscale\n```\n\nThen auth:\n```fish\npscale auth login\n```\n\n(Opens a browser window; sign in with your PlanetScale account.)\n\nWhile that's happening, here's the full Chunk 7 playbook so you can see it end-to-end:\n\n## Chunk 7 step-by-step\n\n### 7.1 — Schema branch + apply migration\n\n```fish\n# Create the schema branch\npscale branch create entire-io recap-facets-migration\n\n# In one terminal: open a connection to the branch\npscale connect entire-io recap-facets-migration --port 3309\n# Leave this running\n\n# In another terminal (from the recap-endpoint worktree):\ncd /Users/peytonmontei/Documents/entire/devenv/entireio/entire.io/.worktrees/recap-endpoint\nenv DATABASE_URL=\"mysql://root:@127.0.0.1:3309/entire-io\" pnpm --dir api exec tsx scripts/migrate.ts\n```\n\nVerify it landed:\n```fish\ndocker exec -i $(docker ps -qf name=mysql) mysql -h 127.0.0.1 -P 3309 -uroot entire-io -e \"SHOW TABLES LIKE 'repo_checkpoint_analysis_%'\"\n```\n(Or just trust the migrate output — it logs success.)\n\n### 7.2 — Open deploy request\n\n```fish\npscale deploy-request create entire-io recap-facets-migration\n```\n\nThis opens a deploy request on PlanetScale. **A human (you, or whoever owns DB ops) needs to approve it via the web UI** at https://app.planetscale.com → entire-io → Deploy Requests.\n\nOnce approved:\n```fish\npscale deploy-request deploy entire-io <number>\n```\n\n(`<number>` is the deploy-request ID printed when you opened it.)\n\n### 7.3 — Backfill production\n\n```fish\n# Open a proxy to prod main\npscale connect entire-io main --port 3310\n# leave running\n\n# In another terminal:\ncd /Users/peytonmontei/Documents/entire/devenv/entireio/entire.io/.worktrees/recap-endpoint\nenv DATABASE_URL=\"mysql://root:@127.0.0.1:3310/entire-io\" pnpm --dir api exec tsx scripts/backfill-analysis-facets.ts --dry-run --limit=100\n# Verify the dry-run output looks sane, then:\nenv DATABASE_URL=\"mysql://root:@127.0.0.1:3310/entire-io\" pnpm --dir api exec tsx scripts/backfill-analysis-facets.ts\n# Long-running — ~5-20 min. Monitor stdout.\n```\n\n### 7.4 — Validate prod-equivalent perf via PR preview\n\nOnce schema + backfill are done, the PR preview deploy that's already running on Cloudflare will be hitting the now-populated facet tables.\n\nFind the preview URL:\n```fish\ngh pr view 1604 --repo entirehq/entire.io --json comments --jq '.comments[].body' | grep -iE 'preview|workers.dev'\n```\n\nThen re-run the perf check:\n```fish\nbash /tmp/perf-check.sh https://<preview-url>.workers.dev\n```\n\n**Decision gate:** all 4 ranges within thresholds (day < 300ms, week < 500ms, month < 700ms, 90d < 1500ms) → proceed. Otherwise → investigate before merging.\n\n### 7.5 — Mark ready, merge\n\n```fish\ngh pr ready 1604 --repo entirehq/entire.io\n# wait for human review + approval\ngh pr merge 1604 --repo entirehq/entire.io --squash\n```\n\n### 7.6 — 24h soak, then remove flag\n\nAfter 24 hours of clean production traffic, remove `USE_FACET_AGGREGATOR` and `mergeAnalysesInto` in a follow-up PR.\n\n### 7.7 — Mark CLI PR ready\n\n```fish\ngh pr ready 1015 --repo entireio/cli\n```\n\n---\n\n**Where to start:**\n1. Run `brew install planetscale/tap/pscale && pscale auth login` first\n2. Then ping me when you're ready for step 7.1 — I'll keep you company through each step\n\nSome steps need human approvals (deploy request) and judgment (validate perf), so this is genuinely a partnered rollout."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":527,"cache_read_input_tokens":837915,"output_tokens":2018,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_r