t problem from the labels/skills/toolMix one we just fixed).\n- Backfilling facet rows on partial-to MIGHT shift these numbers (likely no — the bottleneck isn't there), but worth one more run with backfill done to confirm.\n\n## Three options\n\n| Option | Action |\n|---|---|\n| **A) Ship as-is** — 1-2s is acceptable for a recap call; client cache hides it | Mark PR ready, hand off to entire.io review/deploy |\n| **B) Try to optimize `getByUser`/`getTeamOnUserRepos` first** — separate optimization round | Could shave another 30-50% if SQL plan rewrite works |\n| **C) Run backfill on partial-to first** to confirm numbers don't worsen | Quick check before deciding |\n\n**My recommendation:** **A**. Reasons:\n1. The improvement vs baseline is enormous (60s → 1-2s).\n2. Tier 1 prefetch makes subsequent toggles instant in TUI usage.\n3. Sub-1s for `--day` and `--week` is achievable in real entire.io traffic if data shape is different.\n4. Further `getByUser`/`getTeamOnUserRepos` optimization is a separate concern from the original labels/skills/toolMix problem we set out to solve.\n\nWhat's your call?"}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":6,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1247,"cache_read_input_tokens":914572,"output_tokens":2652,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1247,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":6,"output_tokens":2652,"cache_read_input_tokens":914572,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1247,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1247},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CaYEAJR9zt8J6Aahsvuvm","type":"assistant","uuid":"a358ba8e-6909-4b49-b074-88681f90a7b7","timestamp":"2026-04-29T14:34:48.765Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/peytonmontei/Documents/entire/devenv/entirei