{"parentUuid":"3ee5da09-042d-4ded-9355-64199bfbf974","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-7","id":"msg_01LNcegkzUGoAybUAVHfm3YT","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Both branches updated.\n\n**Two CI failures, two fixes:**\n1. ❌ `oxfmt --check` → ✅ wrapped a long `it.each` callback signature\n2. ❌ OpenAPI drift check → ✅ regenerated `api/docs/openapi.json` to include the new 400 response and the corrected 404 description\n\nPerf branch rebased on the new #1604 head; no openapi drift on the perf branch (the route's response shape didn't change there).\n\nI should have run `mise run check`-equivalent (`pnpm format:check && pnpm typecheck && pnpm test:unit && pnpm --filter entire-api openapi:generate && git diff --exit-code`) locally before pushing, instead of just `pnpm lint`. Lesson logged — saving as feedback memory so I don't repeat it on this codebase."}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":332,"cache_read_input_tokens":306593,"output_tokens":994,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":332,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":1,"output_tokens":994,"cache_read_input_tokens":306593,"cache_creation_input_tokens":332,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":332},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CaYS8HRTomFkE5DWdAggC","type":"assistant","uuid":"d722fcb2-dda2-4516-ac5a-dd5e88a6b9a3","timestamp":"2026-04-29T17:11:10.671Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/peytonmontei/Documents/entire/devenv/entireio/cli/.worktrees/entire-activity","sessionId":"a654b6ca-4957-4d7c-8c99-62db313ff0a0","version":"2.1.119","gitBranch":"entire-activity","slug":"vectorized-whistling-bonbon"}
{"parentUuid":"d722fcb2-dda2-4516-ac5a-dd5e88a6b9a3","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-7","id":"msg_01LNcegkzUGoAybUAVHfm3YT","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01Vs7YfpjX6bd2j9TL5PfHFY","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/Users/peytonmontei/.claude/projects/-Users-peytonmontei-Documents-entire-devenv-entireio-cli/memory/feedback_entire_io_ci_checks.md","content":"---\nname: entire.io CI pre-push checks\ndescription: On entire.io repo, run oxfmt + openapi regen alongside lint/test before pushing — they're separate CI gates from oxlint\ntype: feedback\n---\n\nOn the entire.io repo, the API/Frontend CI jobs run **three** drift checks that fail independently from `pnpm lint` (oxlint):\n\n1. `pnpm run format:check` (oxfmt) — different tool from oxlint\n2. `pnpm --filter entire-api run openapi:generate && git diff --exit-code` — regen drift on `api/docs/openapi.json` from any `describeRoute(...)` response/schema change\n3. `pnpm test:unit` — vitest with the curated unit-only include list\n\n**Why:** Twice in a row I pushed PR #1604 with `pnpm lint` clean and unit tests passing, only to fail CI on oxfmt formatting and OpenAPI drift respectively — each round costing a force-push, a rebase of the stacked perf PR (#1737), and another force-push there.\n\n**How to apply:** Before pushing any change to `api/src/routes/*.ts` (or any TS file with non-trivial new code), run the equivalent of `mise run check`:\n\n```\npnpm format:check && \\\npnpm --filter entire-api typecheck && \\\npnpm --filter entire-api test:unit && \\\npnpm --filter entire-api run openapi:generate && \\\ngit diff --exit-code -- api/docs/openapi.json api/docs/openapi.public.json\n```\n\nIf `format:check` fails, run `pnpm format <file>`. If openapi diff is non-empty, commit the regenerated JSON. Catches both classes of drift before push.\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"i