rame=last-month|last-3-months|last-6-months`** — fallback when explicit dates are absent.\\n\\n## Implementation\\n\\nThis PR matches the pattern established by /me/activity (#1590): route handler in `api/src/routes/recap.ts` fetches checkpoints + analyses and aggregates qualitative fields (labels/skills/MCP/tool-mix) in JS via `mergeAnalysesInto`. ~1,500 lines, including tests + codegen output.\\n\\n**The perf refactor — denormalizing those qualitative fields into SQL-aggregatable tables — lives in #1737, stacked on this PR.** Splitting keeps each review focused: this one is \\\"add the endpoint,\\\" #1737 is \\\"make it fast.\\\" Both should land before the rollout completes.\\n\\n## Pairs with\\n\\n- CLI side: entireio/cli#1015\\n- Perf follow-up: #1737\\n\\n## Test plan\\n\\n- [x] Live smoke vs. local wrangler dev (pointed at staging PlanetScale): `GET /api/v1/me/recap?repo=entireio/cli&since=…&until=…` returns populated agents with labels / skills / toolMix.\\n- [x] `entire recap --view both --insecure-http-auth` (CLI #1015) renders against this endpoint end-to-end.\\n- [x] `pnpm --filter entire-api run typecheck` — clean.\\n- [x] `pnpm --filter entire-api run test:run` — all tests passing.\\n- [x] `pnpm format:check` + `pnpm -r run lint` — clean.\\n\\n## Out of scope (handled in #1737)\\n\\n- Denormalized `repo_checkpoint_analysis_labels` / `_skills` / `_tool_mix` / `_mcp` tables\\n- Worker write path that populates them\\n- Backfill script for existing analyses\\n- SQL `GROUP BY` aggregator replacing `mergeAnalysesInto`\\n- `transcript_tokens` and `files_changed` scalar columns on `repo_checkpoint_analyses`\\n\\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\",\"title\":\"feat(api): /api/v1/me/recap endpoint for per-agent CLI aggregates\"}","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"f32c9403-2594-4351-9941-64973a2b35a5","timestamp":"2026-04-30T10:43:34.096Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"Cloudflare Pages: partial-to-frontend\tpass\t0\thttps://dash.cloudflare.co