cet rows + scalar columns immediately after \\\\`markComplete\\\\` succeeds. Idempotent under retries (DELETE-then-INSERT inside a transaction).\\n\\n**Read path** — \\\\`db.analyses.aggregateFacetsByAgent\\\\` does per-agent fan-out: 4 parallel facet aggregates + 1 parallel scalar SUM per agent, all via \\\\`Promise.all\\\\`. Replaces the JS-side \\\\`mergeAnalysesInto\\\\` loop in \\\\`recap.ts\\\\`.\\n\\n**Backfill** — one-off cursor-paginated script (\\\\`scripts/backfill-analysis-facets.ts\\\\`) that reads existing \\\\`repo_checkpoint_analyses.analysis_json\\\\` rows, parses each blob, and upserts the derived rows. Idempotent. Supports \\\\`--dry-run\\\\` and \\\\`--limit=N\\\\`.\\n\\n**Feature flag** — \\\\`USE_FACET_AGGREGATOR=true\\\\` (default) routes through SQL aggregation; \\\\`=false\\\\` falls back to legacy \\\\`mergeAnalysesInto\\\\`. Kept for 24h post-deploy as a fast-rollback escape hatch, removed in a follow-up.\\n\\n## Validation (on partial.to staging — see #1604 deployment)\\n\\n| Range | hit1 (cold) | hit2 (warm) | hit3 (warm) |\\n|---|---|---|---|\\n| \\\\`--day\\\\` | 2.17s | 0.91s | 0.70s |\\n| \\\\`--week\\\\` | 1.02s | 1.10s | 0.85s |\\n| \\\\`--month\\\\` | 1.40s | 1.26s | 0.92s |\\n| \\\\`--90\\\\` | 1.42s | 1.56s | 1.91s |\\n\\nAll 200s. **Backfill hasn't run on partial-to yet** — the remaining 1-2s is dominated by the upstream checkpoint queries (\\\\`getByUser\\\\`, \\\\`getTeamOnUserRepos\\\\`), unchanged from #1604. The labels/skills/tool_mix aggregation cost is already minimal.\\n\\nPre-refactor baseline: timed out at 60s+ on local wrangler / estimated 2-5s in production. Architecture change confirmed working end-to-end on real Cloudflare Workers + real PlanetScale data.\\n\\n## Rollout sequence\\n\\n1. Merge #1604 first (slim endpoint).\\n2. Merge this PR — schema + worker writes + read path switch.\\n3. Run backfill against entire.io: \\\\`pnpm --dir api exec tsx scripts/backfill-analysis-facets.ts\\\\`.\\n4. 24-hour soak with \\\\`USE_FACET_AGGREGATOR=true\\\\`. If anything's off, flip the flag to \\\\`false\\\\` (env redeploy, no schema work).\\n5. Remove the flag + legacy \\\\`mergeAnalysesInto\\\\` in a follow-up PR.\\n\\n## Tests\\n\\n- 4 new tests in \\\\`recap.test.ts\\\\` (mocked db, route → aggregator pass-through verification)\\n- 13 new tests in \\\\`analyses.test.ts\\\\` (real-MySQL integration: upsertFacets idempotency, GROUP BY scoping, per-agent fan-out, scalar SUMs)\\n- 4 new tests in \\\\`analysis-queue.test.ts\\\\` (worker writes facets after markComplete, success-only contract)\\n\\nTotal: 2041 tests passing post-rebase.\\n\\n## Files\\n\\n- migration: \\\\`api/db/migrations/20260429100000_add_analysis_facet_tables.ts\\\\`\\n- types: \\\\`api/src/lib/db/db-types.ts\\\\`\\n- aggregator: \\\\`api/src/lib/planetscale/analyses.ts\\\\`\\n- worker: \\\\`api/src/lib/analysis-queue.ts\\\\`\\n- backfill: \\\\`api/scripts/backfill-analysis-facets.ts\\\\`\\n- route: \\\\`api/src/routes/recap.ts\\\\`\\n- tests across all of the above\",\"title\":\"perf(recap): aggregate labels & skills in SQL\"}","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"0e36d771-970b-4406-90f5-440142ce725f","timestamp":"2026-04-30T10:43:46.350Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"{\"body\":\"## Summary\\n\\nFollow-up to #1604. Moves /me/recap qualitative aggregates (labels, skills, MCP servers, tool-mix, transcript tokens, files changed) out of `analysis_json` blobs and into denormalized side tables so the route can `GROUP BY` in SQL instead of fetching 1000+ rows of full JSON blobs and aggregating in JS.\\n\\n**Stacks on top of #1604** — base is \\\\`feat/me-recap-endpoint\\\\`. Once #1604 merges, GitHub auto-rebases this onto \\\\`main\\\\` and the diff shows only the perf-specific delta (~1,500 lines).\\n\\n## Why\\n\\n#1604 ships /me/recap matching the /me/activity pattern (fetch checkpoints + analyses, aggregate in JS). Production-equivalent perf measurements showed `--90` recap took 2-5s (estimated) / 60s+ on local wrangler dev —