{"parentUuid":"ce54bd7f-d4ce-4dfb-a02b-cbedf74a2f31","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"5b75148f-df73-4605-b328-6daafc75d92d","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_014p6SzschNiNRSvN7i68Zx7","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t---\n2\tname: entire.io CI pre-push checks\n3\tdescription: On entire.io repo, run oxfmt + openapi regen alongside lint/test before pushing — they're separate CI gates from oxlint\n4\ttype: feedback\n5\toriginSessionId: a654b6ca-4957-4d7c-8c99-62db313ff0a0\n6\t---\n7\tOn the entire.io repo, the API/Frontend CI jobs run **four** drift checks that fail independently from `pnpm lint` (oxlint):\n8\t\n9\t1. `pnpm run format:check` (oxfmt) — different tool from oxlint\n10\t2. `pnpm --filter entire-api run openapi:generate && git diff --exit-code` — regen drift on `api/docs/openapi.json` from any `describeRoute(...)` response/schema change\n11\t3. `pnpm --dir frontend run api:sdk && git diff --exit-code` — frontend SDK is generated FROM `api/docs/openapi.json`, so any openapi change cascades to `frontend/src/gen/api-sdk/types.gen.ts`. Running #2 alone is not enough.\n12\t4. `pnpm test:unit` — vitest with the curated unit-only include list\n13\t\n14\t**Why:** Twice in a row I pushed PR #1604 with `pnpm lint` clean and unit tests passing, only to fail CI on oxfmt formatting and OpenAPI drift respectively — each round costing a force-push, a rebase of the stacked perf PR (#1737), and another force-push there.\n15\t\n16\t**How to apply:** Before pushing any change to `api/src/routes/*.ts` (or any TS file with non-trivial new code), run the equivalent of `mise run check`:\n17\t\n18\t```\n19\tpnpm format:check && \\\n20\tpnpm --filter entire-api typecheck && \\\n21\tpnpm --filter entire-api test:unit && \\\n22\tpnpm --filter entire-api run openapi:generate && \\\n23\tpnpm --dir frontend run api:sdk && \\\n24\tgit diff --exit-code -- api/docs/openapi.json api/docs/openapi.public.json frontend/src/gen/api-sdk\n25\t```\n26\t\n27\tIf `format:check` fails, run `pnpm format <file>`. If openapi or SDK diff is non-empty, commit the regenerated files. Catches all four classes of drift before push.\n28\t\n29\t**Three-strikes context:** PR #1604 round-tripped this three times — first oxfmt, then openapi.json, then frontend SDK. Each round forced a rebase + force-push of the stacked perf PR (#1737). Running ALL four checks locally before a push avoids the cascade.\n30\t"}]},"uuid":"e39916e0-1dbf-4f3f-bcb6-35ce5b3ab603","timestamp":"2026-04-30T16:21:16.834Z","toolUseResult":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/Users/peytonmontei/.claude/projects/-Users-peytonmontei-Documents-entire-devenv-entireio-cli/memory/feedback_entire_io_ci_checks.md","content":"---\nname: entire.io CI pre-push checks\ndescription: On entire.io repo, run oxfmt + openapi regen alongside lint/test before pushing — they're separate CI gates from oxlint\ntype: feedback\noriginSessionId: a654b6ca-4957-4d7c-8c99-62db313ff0a0\n---\nOn the entire.io repo, the API/Frontend CI jobs run **four** drift checks that fail independently from `pnpm lint` (oxlint):\n\n1. `pnpm run format:check` (oxfmt) — different tool from oxlint\n2. `pnpm --filter entire-api run openapi:generate && git diff --exit-code` — regen drift on `api/docs/openapi.json` from any `describeRoute(...)` response/schema change\n3. `pnpm --dir frontend run api:sdk && git diff --exit-code` — frontend SDK is generated FROM `api/docs/openapi.json`, so any openapi change cascades to `frontend/src/gen/api-sdk/types.gen.ts`. Running #2 alone is not enough.\n4. `pnpm test:unit` — vitest with the curated unit-only include list\n\n**Why:** Twice in a row I pushed PR #1604 with `pnpm lint` clean and unit tests passing, only to fail CI on oxfmt formatting and OpenAPI drift respectively — each round costing a force-push, a rebase of the stacked perf PR (#1737), and another force-push there.\n\n**How to apply:** Before pushing any change to `api/src/routes/*.ts` (or any TS file with non-trivial new code), run the equivalent of `mise run check`:\n\n```\npnpm format:check && \\\npnpm --filter entire-api typecheck && \\\npnpm --filter entire-api test:unit && \\\npnpm --filter entire-api run openapi:generate && \\\npnpm --dir frontend run api:sdk && \\\ngit diff --exit-code -- api/docs/openapi.json api/docs/openapi.public.json frontend/src/gen/api-sdk\n```\n\nIf `format:check` fails, run `pnpm format <file>`. If openapi or SDK diff is non-empty, commit the regenerated files. Catches all four classes of drift before push.\n\n**Three-strikes context:** PR #1604 round-tripped this three times — first oxfmt, then openapi.json, then frontend SDK. Each round forced a rebase + force-push of the stacked perf PR (#1737). Running ALL four checks locally before a push avoids the cascade.\n","numLines":30,"startLine":1,"totalLines":30}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"ce54bd7f-d4ce-4dfb-a02b-cbedf74a2f31","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/peytonmontei/Documents/entire/devenv/entireio/cli/.worktrees/entire-activity","sessionId":"a654b6ca-4957-4d7c-8c99-62db313ff0a0","version":"2.1.119","gitBranch":"entire-activity","slug":"vectorized-whistling-bonbon"}
