{"parentUuid":"c5265e2a-2b83-41e1-b4de-3affcc0558fc","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-7","id":"msg_013Vz2zmLTNM1HANAZ1wt5HR","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"There's a layered set of options from cheap → expensive. Recommendation: do steps 1-3 before merge (under 10 minutes), then 4 after merge as the production-reality check.\n\n**1. Local dry-run smoke test** (zero risk — no writes)\n```bash\ncd api && DATABASE_URL=<dev-db-url> pnpm exec tsx scripts/backfill-analysis-tool-metrics.ts --dry-run --limit=20\n```\nConfirms the script bootstraps, paginates, and processes rows. Doesn't validate correctness — just shape.\n\n**2. Targeted before/after on the known-broken Codex checkpoint** (the original signal)\nThat checkpoint we identified at the start of this thread (`7a9387cf9003`) is the load-bearing test case — it had all-zero `toolProfile` because of the old Claude-shaped extractor. Steps:\n- Read its current `analysis_json` from the DB → confirm `toolProfile.categories.shell.count === 0`, `skillsUsed === []`\n- Run the backfill targeting just that row (e.g., `--limit=1` after manually narrowing to its `(repo_id, checkpoint_id)`, or temporarily add a WHERE filter)\n- Re-read `analysis_json` → confirm non-zero shell/fileOps counts and `mcpServersUsed` populated where applicable\n- Verify other fields (`extraction.labels`, `total_transcript_tokens`) are unchanged\n\nThis is the only test that proves agent-aware classification works end-to-end against real production data.\n\n**3. Idempotency check** — run the same `--limit=1` twice. Output should be identical the second time. Validates re-running the backfill is safe.\n\n**4. Post-merge production spot check** — after deploy, hit `GET /api/v1/me/recap?timeframe=last-month` for an account with Codex activity. Inspect the per-agent row for Codex; `toolMix` and `mcpServers` should be populated. This is the user-visible verification.\n\n**Tradeoff:** Step 2 requires either a non-prod DB with that checkpoint's data, or running the backfill against prod with `--limit=1`. The latter is low-blast-radius (single row, idempotent, only overwrites 3 fields) but is a prod write — wants explicit go-ahead.\n\nWhat environment do you want to test against? Local dev, staging, or production with a `--limit=1`?"}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":6,"cache_creation_input_tokens":365,"cache_read_input_tokens":204719,"output_tokens":2132,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":365,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":6,"output_tokens":2132,"cache_read_input_tokens":204719,"cache_creation_input_tokens":365,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":365},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CacPot5JdKCUN2aMvd2Jz","type":"assistant","uuid":"fb3121f1-13d5-4124-bfe9-5236c5cbe3fe","timestamp":"2026-05-01T19:23:36.390Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/peytonmontei/Documents/entire/devenv/entireio/cli/.worktrees/entire-activity","sessionId":"a654b6ca-4957-4d7c-8c99-62db313ff0a0","version":"2.1.119","gitBranch":"entire-activity","slug":"vectorized-whistling-bonbon"}
